sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tendero as Tendero (Voice User)
    participant UI as Frontend (VoiceTurnManager.js)
    participant STTRoute as Backend (/agente/transcribir-audio)
    participant Whisper as Groq Whisper Cloud
    participant AgentRoute as Backend (/agente/mensaje)
    participant Orchestrator as AgenteIaFacade & FSM Orchestrator
    participant LLM as Google Gemini / Groq LLM
    participant CommandStore as DB (agent_commands)
    participant DomainFacade as InventarioFacade / VentasFacade

    Tendero->>UI: Speaks: "Llegaron 10 kilos de arroz a 3500"
    UI->>UI: Captures Audio stream (WebM/Opus)
    UI->>STTRoute: POST /agente/transcribir-audio (audio binary)
    STTRoute->>Whisper: whisper-large-v3 transcription
    Whisper-->>STTRoute: Transcribed text: "Llegaron 10 kilos de arroz a 3500"
    STTRoute-->>UI: {texto: "Llegaron 10 kilos de arroz a 3500"}

    UI->>AgentRoute: POST /agente/mensaje {mensaje, conversation_id}
    AgentRoute->>Orchestrator: procesar_mensaje(conversation_id, mensaje)
    Orchestrator->>LLM: Parse intent and extract parameters {action: REABASTECER, item: "arroz", qty: 10, cost: 3500}
    LLM-->>Orchestrator: Intent JSON output
    Orchestrator->>CommandStore: INSERT INTO agent_commands (command_id, status=PENDIENTE) per BR-12
    Orchestrator->>DomainFacade: reabastecer_stock(empresa_id, "arroz", 10, 3500)
    DomainFacade-->>Orchestrator: Stock updated successfully
    Orchestrator->>CommandStore: UPDATE agent_commands SET status=EJECUTADO
    Orchestrator-->>AgentRoute: {texto_respuesta: "Listo, agregué 10 kilos de arroz al inventario.", accion: "REABASTECER"}
    AgentRoute-->>UI: 200 OK Response JSON
    UI->>UI: Updates product table in React state
    UI-->>Tendero: Speaks audio feedback via TTS: "Listo, agregué 10 kilos de arroz..."
